<Defs>
 <XenotypeDef>
  <defName>LP_FireGiant</defName>
  <label>火巨人</label>
  <description>来自熔火血脉的巨人族，血脉会遗传给子女。成年火巨人的体型为普通人的2.0倍（血脉体型倍率上限），身体部位更坚韧，但行动迟缓。他们完全免疫火焰、不会被点燃、极其耐热，却有些怕冷。火巨人天生热爱手工，亲手制作的物品品质更好；他们不在乎赤身裸体，能穿普通衣服，也有只有巨人能穿的专属衣甲，并且是唯一能够在熔火锻炉工作的种族。在巨人的阶序里，火巨人排在霜巨人之上，与霜巨人是世仇。</description>
  <descriptionShort>可遗传的熔火巨人种族。高大坚韧，行动缓慢，完全免疫火焰，怕冷，擅长手工且成品品质更好，不在乎裸体，能穿普通衣服与巨人专属衣甲，可使用熔火锻炉。</descriptionShort>
  <iconPath>FireGiant/FireGiantGene</iconPath>
  <inheritable>true</inheritable>
  <combatPowerFactor>1.6</combatPowerFactor>
  <genes><li>Body_Hulk</li><li>Skin_DeepRed</li><li>LP_FireGiantCore</li><li>AptitudeRemarkable_Crafting</li><li>MinTemp_SmallIncrease</li><li>MaxTemp_LargeIncrease</li></genes>
 </XenotypeDef>
 <GeneDef>
  <defName>LP_FireGiantCore</defName>
  <label>熔火巨人本源</label>
  <description>火巨人的熔火血脉，可随种族遗传。健壮体型与深红皮肤由《生物科技》原版外表基因提供。成年后体型为普通人的2.0倍（血脉体型倍率上限）；体型越大，生命和近战越强（见巨躯规则：成年生命总量×150%、近战伤害×130%），行动缓慢。完全免疫火焰伤害且不会被点燃。用手工技能制作物品时，有50%概率让品质提高一档（最高到大师级）。火巨人不会因为裸体而心情低落。普通衣服会随巨躯一起放大；锻工外衣、熔铁和熔核装备只有巨人能穿，穿在身上心情更好（合身的巨人之衣）。只有火巨人能在熔火锻炉工作，并且他们工作时锻炉只消耗一半燃料。</description>
  <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_FireGiant</geneClass>
  <iconPath>FireGiant/FireGiantGene</iconPath>
  <displayCategory>ResistanceAndWeakness</displayCategory>
  <biostatCpx>4</biostatCpx><biostatMet>-4</biostatMet>
  <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
  <statFactors><MoveSpeed>0.8</MoveSpeed><Flammability>0</Flammability></statFactors>
  <damageFactors><Flame>0</Flame></damageFactors>
  <exclusionTags><li>FireDamage</li></exclusionTags>
  <customEffectDescriptions>
   <li>健壮体型与深红皮肤由原版外表基因提供。</li>
   <li>体型随年龄增长，成年达到最大倍率×2.0。</li>
   <li>巨躯规则：体型越大，生命和近战越强。成年生命总量×150%、近战伤害×130%（可在模组设置调整；关闭时生命仍×150%）。</li>
      <li>巨胃：饱食度上限随体型提高，成年×200%（儿童随年龄增长）；饥饿速度不变，一顿撑得更久。</li>
   <li>移动速度：×80%。</li>
   <li>完全免疫火焰伤害，不会被点燃。</li>
   <li>手工制作物品时50%概率品质+1档（最高大师级）。</li>
   <li>不会因裸体产生负面心情。</li>
   <li>巨人血统：火巨人（阶序第3位，高于霜巨人）。能穿普通衣服；巨人专属衣甲只有巨人能穿，每件心情+2（最多+6）。</li>
   <li>只有火巨人可使用熔火锻炉，锻炉燃料消耗减半。</li>
  </customEffectDescriptions>
  <modExtensions>
   <li Class="LichPhylactery.GiantKinExtension"><rank>3</rank><element>fire</element><label>火巨人</label><adultSize>2.0</adultSize><renderScale>2.0</renderScale></li>
  </modExtensions>
 </GeneDef>
 <ThingDef ParentName="BenchBase">
  <defName>LP_FireGiantForge</defName>
  <label>熔火锻炉</label>
  <description>用于锻造火巨人专属装备的大型炉台，只有具有熔火巨人本源的角色能在此工作。需要木材或化学燃料，只在工作时消耗燃料；火巨人工作时燃料消耗减半。</description>
  <thingClass>Building_WorkTable</thingClass>
  <graphicData><texPath>FireGiant/Forge</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass><drawSize>(3,2)</drawSize></graphicData>
  <size>(3,2)</size>
  <altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer>
  <passability>PassThroughOnly</passability>
  <pathCost>50</pathCost>
  <fillPercent>0.5</fillPercent>
  <designationCategory>Production</designationCategory>
  <hasInteractionCell>true</hasInteractionCell>
  <interactionCellOffset>(0,0,-2)</interactionCellOffset>
  <surfaceType>Item</surfaceType>
  <statBases><MaxHitPoints>400</MaxHitPoints><WorkToBuild>6000</WorkToBuild><Mass>100</Mass><Flammability>0</Flammability><WorkTableWorkSpeedFactor>1</WorkTableWorkSpeedFactor></statBases>
  <costList><Steel>180</Steel><BlocksGranite>80</BlocksGranite><ComponentIndustrial>4</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
  <inspectorTabs><li>ITab_Bills</li></inspectorTabs>
  <building><workTableRoomRole>Workshop</workTableRoomRole></building>
  <comps>
   <li Class="CompProperties_Refuelable">
    <fuelConsumptionRate>80</fuelConsumptionRate>
    <fuelCapacity>50</fuelCapacity>
    <fuelFilter><thingDefs><li>WoodLog</li><li>Chemfuel</li></thingDefs></fuelFilter>
    <consumeFuelOnlyWhenUsed>true</consumeFuelOnlyWhenUsed>
    <showAllowAutoRefuelToggle>true</showAllowAutoRefuelToggle>
   </li>
  </comps>
  <researchPrerequisites><li>LP_GiantForging</li></researchPrerequisites>
 </ThingDef>
 <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelMakeableBase">
  <defName>LP_FireGiantTunic</defName>
  <label>火巨人锻工外衣</label>
  <description>为巨人缝制的厚重锻工外衣，只能在熔火锻炉制作。只有巨人能穿；穿在中层，外面还能罩一件大氅或外衣。</description>
  <graphicData><texPath>FireGiant/Tunic</texPath><graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass></graphicData>
  <costStuffCount>100</costStuffCount>
  <stuffCategories><li>Fabric</li></stuffCategories>
  <thingCategories><li>ApparelMisc</li></thingCategories>
  <statBases><MaxHitPoints>250</MaxHitPoints><WorkToMake>12000</WorkToMake><Mass>3</Mass><StuffEffectMultiplierArmor>0.4</StuffEffectMultiplierArmor><StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold>0.7</StuffEffectMultiplierInsulation_Cold> </statBases>
  <apparel>
   <bodyPartGroups><li>Torso</li><li>Neck</li><li>Shoulders</li><li>Arms</li><li>Legs</li></bodyPartGroups>
   <wornGraphicPath>FireGiant/Worn/Tunic</wornGraphicPath>
   <layers><li>Middle</li></layers>
  </apparel>
  <modExtensions><li Class="LichPhylactery.GiantApparelExtension"><mood>2</mood></li></modExtensions>
 </ThingDef>
 <RecipeDef>
  <defName>LP_MakeFireGiantTunic</defName>
  <label>制作火巨人锻工外衣</label>
  <jobString>正在锻造火巨人锻工外衣。</jobString>
  <workSpeedStat>GeneralLaborSpeed</workSpeedStat>
  <workSkill>Crafting</workSkill>
  <workAmount>12000</workAmount>
  <ingredients>
   <li><filter><thingDefs><li>Cloth</li></thingDefs></filter><count>100</count></li>
   <li><filter><thingDefs><li>Steel</li></thingDefs></filter><count>60</count></li>
  </ingredients>
  <fixedIngredientFilter><thingDefs><li>Cloth</li><li>Steel</li></thingDefs></fixedIngredientFilter>
  <products><LP_FireGiantTunic>1</LP_FireGiantTunic></products>
  <recipeUsers><li>LP_FireGiantForge</li></recipeUsers>
 </RecipeDef>
 <WorkGiverDef>
  <defName>LP_DoFireGiantForge</defName>
  <label>在熔火锻炉工作</label>
  <giverClass>WorkGiver_DoBill</giverClass>
  <workType>Smithing</workType>
  <priorityInType>120</priorityInType>
  <fixedBillGiverDefs><li>LP_FireGiantForge</li></fixedBillGiverDefs>
  <verb>锻造</verb><gerund>正在熔火锻炉工作</gerund>
  <requiredCapacities><li>Manipulation</li></requiredCapacities>
  <prioritizeSustains>true</prioritizeSustains>
 </WorkGiverDef></Defs>
